  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Engram</strong></p><p><strong>Pyrokinesis:</strong> Make a <strong>Power Roll</strong> against a target within Very Close range. On a success, <strong>spend a Hope</strong> to deal them <strong>d8 + your Power Trait</strong> energy damage and make them become temporarily <em>Ignited</em>. While <em>Ignited</em>, they take <strong>2d6</strong> energy damage if they are still Ignited at the end of their action.</p><p><strong>Telekinetic Grasp:</strong> Make a <strong>Power Roll</strong> against a target in Close range. On a success, <strong>mark a Stress</strong> to lift a target you can see and lift them in the air, moving them within Close range of their original position. You can choose to throw them up to Close range and deal them <strong>d8 + your Power Trait</strong> kinetic damage.</p>",
